\" data-name=\"▲速度2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲速度2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"red\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 全屏.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a0/ie5io1z5wooaxi4ks7ssi3g7twn6ccm.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%8F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a0/ie5io1z5wooaxi4ks7ssi3g7twn6ccm.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BC%8A%E5%A5%87\" title=\"角色图鉴库/伊奇\"><img alt=\"头像 伊奇.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a6/o7ebxjdocgznj2m1ce3yhs1oxlz9tnt.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">伊奇</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%96%87%E5%B0%94%E5%BE%B7%E6%96%A5%E5%80%99\" title=\"角色图鉴库/薇尔德斥候\"><img alt=\"头像 薇尔德斥候.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/16/5rxzcy6ztqz